# The root .gitattributes normalizes every path under web/ to text/LF ("web/** text eol=lf"), which corrupts
# binary font files (autocrlf strips bytes it mistakes for CRLF). Mark the vendored fonts binary here: a
# .gitattributes closer to the path wins over the root one.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
# The same for every other binary under web/: the landing site's tracked goldens and any picture, sound or movie
# (the game-derived ones are ignored, but a binary must never be normalised if one is ever tracked).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
